WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.922
嗨！今天学用关系代词和分词把两个句子合成一句。这是五年级句子合并题里常考的。

2
00:00:12.072 --> 00:00:21.234
who 指人，而且是做动作的人：The girl won. She is my friend，变成 The girl who won is my friend。

3
00:00:21.384 --> 00:00:31.050
whom 指人，是被别人做动作的：You met the boy. He is my cousin，变成 The boy whom you met is my cousin。

4
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:39.906
whose 表示谁的：I met a man. His dog was lost，变成 I met a man whose dog was lost。

5
00:00:40.056 --> 00:00:47.202
which 指东西或动物：I bought the book，变成 This is the book which I bought。

6
00:00:47.352 --> 00:00:54.474
where 指地方：We play in the park，变成 This is the park where we play。

7
00:00:54.624 --> 00:01:06.858
分词也能合并句子。He finished his homework. He went out to play，变成 Having finished his homework, he went out to play，表示先做完功课。

8
00:01:07.008 --> 00:01:18.066
She heard the news. She cried，变成 Hearing the news, she cried。两个句子的主语必须是同一个人。

9
00:01:18.216 --> 00:01:23.010
小心！This is the book which I bought it 是错的！

10
00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:29.106
which 已经代替了 the book，后面再写 it，就重复了。

11
00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:36.618
合并以后，记得删掉重复的 it、him、her 这些词。

12
00:01:36.768 --> 00:01:49.554
轮到你了！The man is a doctor. He lives next door，用 who 合成一句。暂停一下，想一想。

13
00:01:49.704 --> 00:01:56.706
答案是 The man who lives next door is a doctor。你答对了吗？

14
00:01:56.856 --> 00:02:09.690
再来一题！I have a friend. Her mother is a pilot，用 whose 合成一句。暂停一下，想一想。

15
00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:18.930
答案是 I have a friend whose mother is a pilot。whose 代替了 her。你答对了吗？

16
00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:31.698
第三题！Mum opened the door. She saw a parcel，用 Opening 开头。暂停一下，想一想。

17
00:02:31.848 --> 00:02:40.818
答案是 Opening the door, Mum saw a parcel。主语都是妈妈。你答对了吗？

18
00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:54.114
再加一题！This is the hawker centre. We had dinner there，用 where 合成一句。暂停一下，想一想。

19
00:02:54.264 --> 00:03:03.498
答案是 This is the hawker centre where we had dinner。where 代替了 there。你答对了吗？

20
00:03:03.648 --> 00:03:16.914
还有一题！The cake is delicious. My aunt baked it，用 which 合成一句。暂停一下，想一想。

21
00:03:17.064 --> 00:03:25.722
答案是 The cake which my aunt baked is delicious。删掉了 it。你答对了吗？

22
00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:40.170
记住：who 和 whom 指人，whose 是谁的，which 指东西，where 指地方。用分词开头时，两部分的主语要相同。合并后删掉重复的代词。

23
00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:45.402
试着用 whose 介绍一个朋友吧！

